00:08:01.679 --> 00:08:05.440
So Goodbye to Tolerance.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:14.359
Genial poets, pink-faced, earnest wits, you have given the world some choice morsels.

00:08:14.399 --> 00:08:21.000
Gobbits of language presented as one presents t-bone steak and cherries jubilee.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:27.559
Goodbye, goodbye, I do not care if I never taste your fine food again.

00:08:27.559 --> 00:08:37.080
Neutral fellows, seers of every side, tolerance, what crimes are committed in your name.

00:08:37.119 --> 00:08:45.200
And you, good women, bakers of nicest bread, blood donors, your crumbs choke me.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:48.280
I would not want a drop of your blood in me.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:57.479
It is pumped by weak hearts, perfect pulses that never falter, irresponsive to nightmare reality.

00:08:57.479 --> 00:09:05.080
It is my brothers, my sisters, whose blood spurts out and stops forever because you chose

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:08.679
