00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:18.960
And you won't wait.

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:21.599
You're looking another way.

00:09:21.599 --> 00:09:25.400
We shan't meet again unless you leap it.

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:31.359
