00:49:15.500 --> 00:49:16.500
beat him,

00:49:16.500 --> 00:49:17.500
and went away,

00:49:18.500 --> 00:49:19.500
leaving him half dead.

00:49:19.500 --> 00:49:20.500
He was going down that road

00:49:21.500 --> 00:49:22.500
and when he saw him,

00:49:23.500 --> 00:49:24.500
he passed by on the other side.

00:49:25.500 --> 00:49:26.500
So likewise,

00:49:26.500 --> 00:49:27.500
a Levite,

00:49:28.500 --> 00:49:29.500
