being the lawyer,

00:50:19.500 --> 00:50:20.500
it's an interesting answer.

00:50:21.500 --> 00:50:22.500
The one who showed him mercy.

00:50:24.500 --> 00:50:25.500
Jesus said to him,

00:50:25.500 --> 00:50:26.500
