00:50:27.500 --> 00:50:28.500
Right?

00:50:28.500 --> 00:50:29.500
What a tale.

00:50:29.500 --> 00:50:30.500
If there was ever a mic drop moment,

00:50:31.500 --> 00:50:32.500
this is definitely one of them

00:50:33.500 --> 00:50:34.500
for Jesus, right?

00:50:34.500 --> 00:50:35.500
In all the stories.

00:50:35.500 --> 00:50:36.500
Why?

00:50:36.500 --> 00:50:37.500
Well,

00:50:37.500 --> 00:50:38.500
let's go back in

00:50:38.500 --> 00:50:39.500
and let's understand the context

00:50:39.500 --> 00:50:40.500
of how the lawyer

00:50:40.500 --> 00:50:41.500
